// The three real GL calls in this file take no case-observable state (no
// exported global they leave a trace in, and glClear/glLoadMatrixf/
// glDrawArrays have nothing an `id` check could read back), so all a case
// can honestly prove is that the call completes rather than trapping -- a
// no-op probe build first confirmed these run safely with no window open.
clear_and_place(int mv) {
  gl_begin_frame(15, 15, 35);
  gl_set_modelview(mv);
} return void;
